1
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:19,880
The cold wind brushes by,

2
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:24,770
Carrying your scent away with it.

3
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:27,530
Like a final farewell,

4
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:32,700
You quietly stir my heart.

5
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:38,050
My trembling hands once held on,

6
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:42,610
Now slowly let you go.

7
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,660
Even knowing that it’s over,

8
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:51,850
I can’t release the warmth we had.

9
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:05,420
Goodbye, my love, my everything,

10
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:09,870
I won’t try to hold you anymore.

11
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:12,460
Deep within my heart,

12
00:01:12,650 --> 00:01:19,540
I’ll gently lay you down.

13
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:23,990
Under Tokyo’s fading lights,

14
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,970
A silent tear begins to fall.

15
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:31,620
Goodbye, my love, my everything.

16
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:29,800
To forget you

17
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:35,620
maybe impossible.

18
00:02:35,650 --> 00:02:38,530
But now I finally see,

19
00:02:38,550 --> 00:02:45,120
Our story ends right here, 

20
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:49,740
Like the last tone on a needle’s edge,

21
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:54,630
Our song quietly fades away.

22
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:08,200
Goodbye, my love, my everything,

23
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:12,010
The city still shines tonight.

24
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,810
I hope you find your happiness,

25
00:03:14,830 --> 00:03:17,330
Beneath this same endless sky.

26
00:03:17,330 --> 00:03:19,330
Goodbye, my love...

27
00:03:19,330 --> 00:03:23,730
Goodbye, my everything.

